# The declared machine for floor_travel.cam — a VMC's spec-sheet travels
# (Phase 15 slice 1, DECISIONS.md "Phase 15 opens: the envelope DRAFT…").
# The spans are MACHINE coordinates, min then max, in this file's own units;
# they claim nothing until the part declares its datum. There is no travel_z
# on purpose — the key rejects by name (fork 1's Z ruling).
name generic-vmc-30
travel_x -762 0
travel_y -406 0
spindle_max 12000
# Rapid traverse per axis, mm/min — time inputs for --time-report, never
# limits (Phase 16 slice 1). Omit them and the report declines the rapid
# share by name instead of guessing.
rapid_x 36000
rapid_y 36000
rapid_z 24000
atc_pockets 24
